    "title": "MoneyFy planned API contract",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Checkpoint 1 design contract, not an implemented service. All monetary fields are integer INR paise. Dates use ISO 8601. Frontend slider rupee values must be converted at the future adapter boundary. No real banking or payment execution."
  },
